        "markdown": "电力供给对欧洲人工智能产业愿景的约束评估\n\n\n\n\n[RRS](/_wp3services/rssoffer?siteId=477&templateId=2515&columnId=18985)\n\n* [ENGLISH](https://fddi.fudan.edu.cn/fddien/main.htm)\n\n\n\n[![](/_upload/site/01/dd/477/logo.png)](/main.htm \"返回复旦发展研究院首页\")\n\n[搜索](javascript:void(0);)\n\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n|  |  |\n\n\n\n### 导航\n\n* [首页](https://fddi.fudan.edu.cn/)\n* [关于FDDI](/18936/list.htm)\n\n  + [简介](/18941/list.htm)\n  + [历任院长](/lryz/list.htm)\n  + [院领导](/18942/list.htm)\n  + [院董](/18943/list.htm)\n  + [战略合作伙伴](http://fddi.fudan.edu.cn/18991/list.htm)\n\n    - [国际智库](/18991/list.htm)\n    - [政府服务](/18992/list.htm)\n    - [企业合作](/18993/list.htm)\n    - [媒体合作](/18994/list.htm)\n  + [联系我们](/18945/list.htm)\n  + [加入我们](/18946/list.htm)\n* [团队](http://fddi.fudan.edu.cn/18947/list.htm)\n\n  + [国际顾问](/18947/list.htm)\n  + [高级顾问](/gjgw_23477/list.htm)\n  + [专职研究员](/18948/list.htm)\n  + [客座教授/研究员](/18949/list.htm)\n  + [特邀研究员](/18951/list.htm)\n  + [访问学者](/18950/list.htm)\n\n    - [2026](/2026/list.htm)\n    - [2025](/2025/list.htm)\n    - [2024](/2024/list.htm)\n    - [2023](/2023/list.htm)\n    - [2022](/2022/list.htm)\n    - [2021](/2021/list.htm)\n    - [2020](/2020/list.htm)\n    - [2019](/18995/list.htm)\n    - [2018](/18996/list.htm)\n    - [2017](/18997/list.htm)\n    - [2016](/18998/list.htm)\n    - [2015](/18999/list.htm)\n    - [2014](/19000/list.htm)\n    - [2013](/19001/list.htm)\n    - [2012](/19002/list.htm)\n    - [2011](/19003/list.htm)\n    - [2010](/19004/list.htm)\n    - [2009](/19005/list.htm)\n    - [2008](/19006/list.htm)\n    - [2007](/19007/list.htm)\n    - [2006](/19008/list.htm)\n    - [2005](/19009/list.htm)\n    - [2004](/19010/list.htm)\n    - [2003](/19011/list.htm)\n    - [2002](/19012/list.htm)\n    - [2001](/19013/list.htm)\n    - [2000](/19014/list.htm)\n    - [1999](/19015/list.htm)\n  + [博士后团队](/18952/list.htm)\n\n    - [国家治理](/19016/list.htm)\n    - [社会治理](/19017/list.htm)\n    - [传播与治理](/19018/list.htm)\n    - [国际关系](/19019/l